    "detailed_description": "Thank you for coming to my page! My name is Austin and I solely developed this game. I hope to improve my skills and make better games.  I appreciate you giving my game interest!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDisplaced Defense is a traditional, open-world, turn-based RPG. The combat is not meant to be easy and sometimes normal enemies may seem challenging. Use your strategy of enemy weaknesses, classes, and skills to get back home!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n12 Classes and Multiclassing: All classes are available at the beginning of the game. Your character will change appearance based on your primary class. Equip <br />\r\n a secondary class to gain stats and access to their skills!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA combination of leveling up and battles will gain you resources to purchase skills in any order you choose. Build your characters to withstand the hard battles <br />\r\n ahead!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOpen World: The enemies scale with your level and you are free to explore the world to find the story of this new land. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCrafting: There is no one waiting to sell you gear here! Materials will drop off enemies that you can use to craft equipmen**t. The materials scale depending on party level. There is a vendor in the Beginner\u2019s Hall to purchase older materials in case you out level them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck to you and thank you for exploring my world!",
